one monster, what should you take?

The best pet I have had was a vampire lord; it killed monsters reliably
(but I still did half of them in with Excalibur, so I got some
experience), and didn't eat anything.  It also didn't fall into traps.
And I had a magic whistle, so I could always keep the vampire lord
around when I got into trouble.

The one side effect of a powerful pet is that it tends to attack
monsters you want to keep.  I couldn't keep a unicorn alive for long,
and was lucky to be able to preserve my temple priestess; I teleported
out of the room and whistled the vampire away.

The vampire lord met an untimely death when it tried to attack a purple
worm, and got swallowed whole.  But by that time, I didn't need it.
